From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unom <packages@unom.io>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:43:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/40] punktfunk: stamp pfhdr36

A DPI-scaled game showed nothing in a session before the layer fix, and
nothing else tells a box with the fix from one without. A new level puts
the difference on the banner for field triage. No new capability.
---
 src/meson.build | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 518b6e6..655138b 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -228,7 +228,8 @@ vcs_tag = run_command(vcs_tag_cmd, check: false).stdout().strip()
 #   +pfhdr33 — …written into a storage buffer, so its bytes sit where the export says
 #   +pfhdr34 — …and a private reliable capture node beside the public one Steam reads
 #   +pfhdr35 — …on upstream 3.17.0 (31 is upstream there)
-version_tag = vcs_tag + '+pfhdr35' + ' (' + compiler_name + ' ' + compiler_version + ')'
+#   +pfhdr36 — …and the WSI layer reports an X11 window's size as its extent range
+version_tag = vcs_tag + '+pfhdr36' + ' (' + compiler_name + ' ' + compiler_version + ')'
 
 gamescope_version_conf = configuration_data()
 gamescope_version_conf.set('VCS_TAG', version_tag)
